{"title":"Career Roadmap · Insurance Underwriter (Junior)","role":"Insurance Underwriter (Junior)","summary":"An Insurance Underwriter evaluates insurance applications, assesses risk, reviews financial and personal/business information, determines appropriate coverage and supports premium and policy decisions. A junior underwriter typically works under senior underwriting professionals while developing expertise in a particular insurance line.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Course":"B.Com – Actuarial / Insurance"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2028"},{"text":"Insurance, accounting, economics, statistics and risk fundamentals"}],[{"text":"2028–2030"},{"text":"Policy processing, claims awareness and underwriting internship"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Underwriting Trainee / Junior Underwriter"}],[{"text":"2033–2036"},{"text":"Underwriter with product-line specialisation"}],[{"text":"2036–2040"},{"text":"Senior Underwriter / Portfolio Underwriter"}],[{"text":"2040–2043"},{"text":"Underwriting Manager / Risk Manager"}],[{"text":"2043–2046"},{"text":"Head of Underwriting / Chief Underwriting leadership"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Key Skills","Proof"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Finance + risk foundation"},{"text":"Accounting, economics, statistics, Excel"},{"text":"Risk-analysis workbook"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Insurance fundamentals"},{"text":"Policy types, risk, premiums, claims"},{"text":"Insurance case studies"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Underwriting skills"},{"text":"Risk assessment, documentation, analytics"},{"text":"Insurance internship"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Specialisation + technology"},{"text":"Portfolio analysis, automation, fraud analytics"},{"text":"Underwriting caps